        ":question/problem": "Given that $y=\\operatorname{tan}\u2061(\\operatorname{tan}\u2061(x)),$ we have\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={sec}^{2}\u2061(x)\\,\\cdot $\n{{field-1}}.",
